= Token (blockchain) — Simple =

A blockchain token is a ledger record representing some unit, asset, claim, or right. The token can be transferred or controlled according to its rules. A token is not automatically a cryptocurrency, and it is not the off-chain asset it may represent.

'''Important boundary:''' blockchain token ≠ cryptocurrency by definition.

